@startuml
title "As a Buyer, I want to use the Web UI to list %n()items on sale of a given author %n()(direct sales and auctions)." SSD
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

' --- Actor and participants ---
actor Buyer
participant ":MiteLovers" as System

' --- System dialog ---
Buyer -> System : show me want I can do
activate System
System --> Buyer : here is what you can do
deactivate System
Buyer -> System: Selects an author
activate System
System --> Buyer: List of items on direct sale\nand auction of a given author
deactivate System

@enduml